{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54544","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，气似凤（京本作「似凤或」）如龙。\n更若大（京本作「太」）山幷类盖，犹如（辛本作「人」）火（京本作「人大」）赤降城中，其下不堪攻。\n（下必有贵人。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}